Shipped as binaries inside the offline installation bundles
(installers/build-offline-bundle*.sh):

  VictoriaMetrics (single-node, OSS build)
    https://github.com/VictoriaMetrics/VictoriaMetrics
    Apache License 2.0
    Used as SATOM's local time-series store for fleet telemetry, bound to
